 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. 2.1",
  "pages": 4
 },
 "summary": "A PNP bipolar transistor in the three-lead SOT-23 surface-mount package for medium-power amplifier and switching use. It withstands -150 V collector to emitter and -160 V collector to base, carries up to -0.6 A of collector current and dissipates 0.3 W at 25 °C ambient. Its DC gain hFE(2) at -10 mA is 100 to 300, sorted into rank L (100-200) and rank H (200-300); the 200-300 range is rank H. The NPN counterpart is the MMBT5551.",
